Q1. What is AI-powered metro safety?

AI-powered metro safety uses analytics, computer vision and connected EHS information to identify risk patterns, support investigations and help professionals make preventive safety decisions.

Q2. How can IoT improve metro safety?

IoT sensors can provide information about selected equipment and environmental conditions. When appropriately integrated, abnormal readings can support alerts, investigation and corrective action.

Q3. What is connected worker technology?

Connected worker technology gives frontline personnel access to digital inspections, hazard reporting, safety instructions, notifications and other authorized field information.

